Claude Code in CT 30100 — main session (tmux), status, logs, restart, update.

  claude                 attach to the main session "Container Auto Session" (tmux)
  claude attach --read-only   watch only, keystrokes are not sent
  claude shell           plain shell in the container (user claude)
  claude status          claude-status.sh: binary, sign-in, services, repos, disk
  claude logs [--follow] journal of claude-tmux + claude-remote
  claude restart         restart both services — ends open sessions (asks)
  claude update          claude update + restart (asks)

  Detach from tmux: Ctrl+b, then d — claude keeps running.
  Same session in the app / claude.ai/code: environment "homelab".
  Docs: ~/Dokumente/manuals/homelab/5_9_Clients_Claude*.md
